%
% AC-3 (genuine tie): an over-determined antecedent {blue, green} for the slot
% flag(x, ·) with NO entrenchment edge between the values -> incomparable maximum
% -> the deterministic profile declines to branch and returns status "unknown".
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/worlds-c/revision/').
:- counterfactual(ex:cf, ex:base).
:- assume(ex:flag(ex:x, ex:blue)).
:- assume(ex:flag(ex:x, ex:green)).
?- ex:flag(ex:x, Z).
